msgid "Speed the fan up for the modem"
msgstr ""

msgid "Where the kernel drives the fan, its switching temperatures are lowered while the modem runs hotter than the processor, so the fan speeds up for the modem as well. They only ever go down, never above the base values. A missing modem reading keeps them where they are."
msgstr ""

